# SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
# The fallback mark. Original to the Agora project and dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.
# Hand-written in the same format as the generated OS marks.
# Three bars, 3 units thick with 3-unit gaps, centred in the 16-unit box: the geometry the
# compositor drew before the marks became vector data.
id hamburger
grid 16
fill evenodd
M 0 0.5
L 16 0.5
L 16 3.5
L 0 3.5
Z
M 0 6.5
L 16 6.5
L 16 9.5
L 0 9.5
Z
M 0 12.5
L 16 12.5
L 16 15.5
L 0 15.5
Z
